# 统一换行，避免 CI / 不同系统上出现 CRLF 抖动
# 文本文件默认 LF；Windows 批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出问题
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不要做任何换行/文本转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.silk binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.pth binary
*.index binary
*.onnx binary
*.npy binary
*.pt binary

# 依赖锁文件不要被换行改写
pnpm-lock.yaml text eol=lf -diff
package-lock.json text eol=lf -diff
